# Node.js Development

## Project Structure
Use a standardized layout:
```
src/
├ controllers/     # HTTP route handlers
├ services/        # Business logic
├ models/          # DB schemas/ORM
├ middleware/      # Express middleware
├ utils/           # Helper functions
├ config/          # Configuration loaders
└ tests/           # Unit & integration tests
```
Reference: [src/server.js](mdc:src/server.js), [package.json](mdc:package.json)

## Package Scripts
Define npm scripts in `package.json`:
```json
{
  "scripts": {
    "start": "node src/server.js",
    "dev": "nodemon src/server.js",
    "test": "jest --runInBand",
    "lint": "eslint 'src/**/*.{js,ts}'",
    "format": "prettier --write 'src/**/*.{js,ts,json,md}'"
  }
}
```

## Environment Configuration
- Use `dotenv`: `npm install dotenv`
- Create `.env.example`:
```
PORT=3000
DATABASE_URL=postgres://user:pass@localhost:5432/db
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379
JWT_SECRET=your_secret_key
```
- Load in [src/config/index.js](mdc:src/config/index.js):
```javascript
require('dotenv').config();
module.exports = { port: process.env.PORT, dbUrl: process.env.DATABASE_URL, ... };
```

## Linting & Formatting
- ESLint config: [/.eslintrc.js](mdc:.eslintrc.js)
- Prettier config: [/.prettierrc](mdc:.prettierrc)
- Commands:
```
npm run lint
npm run format
```

## Error Handling & Logging
- Global error handler: [src/middleware/errorHandler.js](mdc:src/middleware/errorHandler.js)
- Structured logging: [src/utils/logger.js](mdc:src/utils/logger.js)
```javascript
app.use((err, req, res, next) => {
  logger.error(err);
  res.status(err.status || 500).json({ error: err.message });
});
```

## Testing
- Use Jest & Supertest:
```javascript
// tests/health.test.js
const request = require('supertest');
const app = require('../src/server');

test('GET /health', async () => {
  const res = await request(app).get('/health');
  expect(res.status).toBe(200);
});
```
- Run: `npm run test`

## Debugging
- Start with inspector:
```
node --inspect-brk src/server.js
```
- Use VSCode breakpoints

## Security Best Practices
- Input validation with Joi/Zod: [src/middleware/validate.js](mdc:src/middleware/validate.js)
- Rate limiting with `express-rate-limit`
- HTTP headers with `helmet`
- CORS config: [src/middleware/cors.js](mdc:src/middleware/cors.js)

